  "question": {
    "text": "A uniform sphere of weight $W$ and radius $5 \\mathrm{~cm}$ is being held by a string as shown in the figure. The tension in the string will be :\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/zjyKE9igQmcB8i7BnxEA2MburJFznauc_ZClkBQZxLA.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "1ssiA",
      "text": "\n$12 \\frac{W}{5}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Q0mIs",
      "text": "\n$5 \\frac{W}{12}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "SZuRN",
      "text": "\n$13 \\frac{W}{5}$\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "3vOhq",
      "text": "\n$13 \\frac{\\mathrm{W}}{12}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/q5ZBiisnFH5qS7NLcaXJ7_f8SzqdYI5SnKij5SLMZ50.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{PQ}=\\sqrt{\\mathrm{OP}^2+\\mathrm{OQ}^2} \\\\\n& =\\sqrt{13^2+5^2}=12\n\\end{aligned}$\nTension in the string $\\mathrm{T}$, so, $\\mathrm{T} \\cos \\theta=\\mathrm{w}$\n$\\Rightarrow \\mathrm{T}=\\frac{\\mathrm{w}}{\\cos \\theta}=\\frac{13}{12} \\mathrm{~W}$",
    "image": null
  },
